## MASTER CONTEXT — PASTE THIS AT START OF EVERY SESSION

```
PROJECT: Southern Suites Hotel Booking SaaS
9 hotels across Andhra Pradesh, India
Stack: Next.js 14 App Router, Supabase, Tailwind CSS, TypeScript strict, Razorpay, Resend
Design: Navy #1B2A4A + Gold #C9A84C. Fonts: Playfair Display + Inter
Mobile first. MNC level. Jaw dropping UI. No hardcoding. No demo payment.
Auth check on every API route. Soft delete everywhere. INR currency. Indian phone format.

Schema: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skorpixindia-max/Southern-Suites-v.0.1/refs/heads/main/schema.sql

