## ACCOUNT 4 — COPY PASTE PROMPT

```
PROJECT: Southern Suites Hotel Booking SaaS
9 hotels across Andhra Pradesh, India
Stack: Next.js 14 App Router, Supabase, Tailwind CSS, TypeScript strict, Razorpay, Resend
Mobile first. MNC level. No hardcoding. No demo payment. INR currency.

Schema: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skorpixindia-max/Southern-Suites-v.0.1/refs/heads/main/schema.sql

YOUR SESSION 1 TASK:
Write booking API routes. Prevent double booking. Server validates amount never client.
app/api/bookings/create/route.ts — check availability first, create guest if new, create booking, decrement availability
app/api/bookings/cancel/route.ts — update status, trigger refund if paid
app/api/bookings/availability/route.ts — return available dates for calendar
app/api/bookings/check-availability/route.ts — check specific dates before booking
app/api/bookings/[id]/route.ts — get single booking details

YOUR SESSION 2 TASK:
Write payment files. Amount calculated server side never trusted from client.
app/api/payment/create-order/route.ts — get price from DB, create Razorpay order
app/api/payment/refund/route.ts — initiate Razorpay refund
app/api/webhooks/razorpay/route.ts — verify signature, confirm booking, trigger notifications
lib/payments/razorpay.ts — createOrder, verifySignature functions
lib/payments/refund.ts — processRefund function
lib/payments/webhook.ts — handleWebhook function

YOUR SESSION 3 TASK:
Write validation files using zod:
lib/validations/booking.ts
lib/validations/hotel.ts
lib/validations/guest.ts
lib/validations/payment.ts

Start Session 1 now.
```

