lib/notifications/dispatcher.ts — decides email vs whatsapp vs both
lib/google/places.ts — fetch live reviews and rating using Place ID
lib/invoice/gst.ts — calculate GST 12% below 2500, 18% above 2500
lib/invoice/pdf.ts — generate PDF invoice
lib/audit.ts — log every admin action to audit_log table
lib/utils.ts — formatCurrency, formatDate, calculateNights, generateBookingId

