---

## WHAT YOU DO AFTER EACH FILE

```
1. Claude gives you complete file code
2. Go to github.com/skorpixindia-max/Southern-Suites-v.0.1
3. Click Add file → Create new file
4. Type exact file path example: lib/auth/jwt.ts
5. Paste the code
6. Click Commit new file
7. Mark ✅ in progress tracker above
8. Continue to next file in same session
```

---

## ENV VARIABLES — CREATE THIS FILE IN REPO

Filename: .env.example
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
NEXT_PUBLIC_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RESEND_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
JWT_SECRET=minimum-32-characters-random-string
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
```

---

## SUPABASE — RUN SCHEMA

```
1. Go to supabase.com
2. Open your project
3. Click SQL Editor
4. Click New Query
5. Go to github.com/skorpixindia-max/Southern-Suites-v.0.1
6. Open schema.sql
7. Click Raw
8. Copy all the SQL
9. Paste in Supabase SQL Editor
10. Click Run
11. Should show Success
```

